ata has rows for each state\n\nI notice that the census data has POPESTIMATE2025 for 2025, which shows 341,784,857 for the US.\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Create a build script that joins the two tables and creates a metric for farmers markets per 100,000 residents\n2. The join will need to be on state level\n\nActually, looking at the data more carefully:\n- The farmers markets table has state-level data\n- The census table has both state-level and national/regional summary data\n- I need to sum the farmers markets across all states and get the US population from the census data\n\nLet me create a build script that:\n1. Reads both datasets\n2. Sums the farmers_markets column to get the total\n3. Gets the US population from the census data (where NAME = \"United States\")\n4. Calculates the metric\n\nLet me check the farmers markets data a bit more to see all the states.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01V7XtgGLhLJxVAobrERG6RD","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.aggregate(total_markets=source.farmers_markets.sum())"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":14,"output":376,"cacheRead":16987,"cacheWrite":3341,"totalTokens":20718,"cost":{"input":0.000014,"output":0.0018800000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0016987000000000003,"cacheWrite":0.00417625,"total":0.00776895},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":260},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915236372,"responseId":"msg_011Ce78L24mSzypmz8RTP39A","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01V7XtgGLhLJxVAobrERG6RD","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"total_markets\"\n7944\n\n(showing up to 50 rows; pass limit or aggregate to count — do not page)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915243200},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great! The total farmers markets is 7,944. Now let me get the US population from the census data.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_015MNHPzwW1vNZLELNVcgmQH","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"census","compose":"source.filter(source.NAME == \"United States\").select(\"POPESTIMATE2025\")"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":148,"cacheRead":20328,"cacheWrite":424,"totalTokens":20912,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.0007400000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0020328,"cacheWrite":0.00053,"total":0.0033148},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":29},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915243200,"responseId":"msg_011Ce78LWvMG8t3KfBynW9M6","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_015MNHPzwW1vNZLELNVcgmQH","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"POPESTIMATE2025\"\n341784857\n\n(showing up to 50 rows; pass limit or aggregate to count — do not page)"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915247010},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! The 2025 US population is 341,784,857. Now I need to calculate the rate:\n(7,944 / 341,784,857) * 100,000 = 2.3237...\n\nBut I should do this calculation through the catalog using a build script and then select it, to ensure it's verified by the checker. Let me create a derived metric that joins the totals and calculates the per-capita rate.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create a derived metric for farmers markets per 100,000 residents:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01Pv5YEXSKfSkL3ihDDByLrB","name":"write","arguments":{"path":".xorq/scripts/build_markets_per_capita.py","content":"import urllib.request as u\n_o = u.build_opener(); _o.addheaders = [(\"User-Agent\", \"Mozilla/5.0\")]; u.install_opener(_o)\n\nfrom xorq.vendor.ibis.common.collections import FrozenDict\nimport xorq.api as xo\n\nso = FrozenDict({\"User-Agent\": \"Mozilla/5.0\"})\ncon = xo.pandas.connect()\n\nfact = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv\",\n    con, table_name=\"farmers_markets\",\n    storage_options=so)\n\nref = xo.deferred_read_csv(\n    \"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv\",\n    con, table_name=\"census\",\n    storage_options=so)\n\n# Aggregate farmers markets total\ntotals = fact.aggregate(total_markets=fact.farmers_markets.sum()).mutate(k=xo.literal(1))\n\n# Get US population\ndenom = (ref.filter(ref.NAME == \"United States\")\n            .select(\"POPESTIMATE2025\").mutate(k=xo.literal(1)))\n\n# Join and calculate metric\nexpr = (\n    totals.join(denom, totals.k == denom.k)\n      .mutate(markets_per_100k=totals.total_markets / denom.POPESTIMATE2025 * 100000)\n      .select(\"total_markets\", \"POPESTIMATE2025\", \"markets_per_100k\")\n)\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":638,"cacheRead":20752,"cacheWrite":198,"totalTokens":21600,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.00319,"cacheRead":0.0020752,"cacheWrite":0.0002475,"total":0.0055247000000000004},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":105},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786915247010,"responseId":"msg_011Ce78Lmi6NYYckpBkYyR5q","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01Pv5YEXSKfSkL3ihDDByLrB","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully wrote 1146 bytes to .xorq/scripts/build_markets_per_capita.py"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786915254679},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me build this script and add it to the catalog.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01XyRtMeM14E8JVxABZc5yT7","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /private/tmp/trial-pi-79-slg3g7xp && xorq build .xorq/scripts/build_markets_per_capita.py --builds-dir .xorq/builds --emit-build-path-to /tmp/bp_metric.txt && cat /tmp/bp_metric.txt"}}],"api":"anthropic-mes